driven tools to electrical panel fabricators, procurement engineers, and industrial electricians across the UAE and the broader MENA region. The platform is developed and maintained by the digital marketing team of ",["$","strong",null,{"style":{"color":"#f0f0f0"},"children":"PAYAP MACHINERY"}]," (trading as PAYAPRESS), a manufacturer and distributor of electrical machinery and press equipment."]}],["$","p",null,{"style":"$a:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:style","children":["The platform is currently in active development and scheduled to launch in ",["$","strong",null,{"style":{"color":"#f0f0f0"},"children":"June 2026"}],". Phase 1 focuses on the Copper Busbar Cost Calculator — a professional-grade tool supporting live COMEX HG=F market pricing, 22 currencies with Gulf central-bank peg rates, and full IEC/DIN material-grade compliance."]}],["$","p",null,{"style":"$a:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:style","children":"Following the initial launch, the platform will expand over six months with live metal price dashboards, equipment and component cost databases, industry news aggregation, and specialized technical encyclopedias — evolving into a comprehensive industrial intelligence suite for the electrical sector."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"style":"$a:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:props:children:2:props:style","children":[["$","h2",null,{"style":"$a:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:props:children:2:props:children:0:props:style","children":"2. Problem Statement"}],["$","p",null,{"style":"$a:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:style","children":"Electrical panel fabricators — particularly small-to-medium workshops in the UAE and the MENA region — rely on manual, spreadsheet-based cost estimation for copper busbars. Key pain points include:"}],["$","ul",null,{"style":{"paddingLeft":"1.5rem","listStyleType":"disc","fontSize":"0.9rem","lineHeight":1.75,"color":"#a1a1aa","marginBottom":"0.5rem"},"children":[["$","li",null,{"style":{"marginBottom":"0.5rem","color":"#a1a1aa","fontSize":"0.9rem","lineHeight":1.7},"children":[["$","strong",null,{"style":{"color":"#d4d4d8"},"children":"Stale pricing"}]," — copper prices change daily; manually tracking COMEX leads to systematic under- or over-quoting."]}],["$","li",null,{"style":"$a:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:props:children:3:props:children:2:props:children:0:props:style","children":[["$","strong",null,{"style":{"color":"#d4d4d8"},"children":"Currency friction"}]," — multi-currency quoting requires manual FX lookups; Gulf-pegged currencies (AED, SAR, KWD, QAR, BHD) are often mishandled."]}],"$Le","$Lf","$L10"]}]]}],"$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18"]}]}]]}],null,"$L19"]}]
