ice"}]," fetches COMEX HG=F (Copper Futures) from Yahoo Finance with a 5-minute server-side cache. The price is returned in ",["$","code",null,{"style":"$12:props:children:6:props:children:1:props:style","children":"USD/lb"}]," and converted to ",["$","code",null,{"style":"$12:props:children:6:props:children:1:props:style","children":"USD/kg"}]," using the exact conversion factor ",["$","code",null,{"style":"$12:props:children:6:props:children:1:props:style","children":"× 2.20462"}],". A static fallback value activates automatically when the upstream feed is unavailable."]}],["$","h3",null,{"style":"$12:props:children:1:props:style","children":"4.3 Foreign Exchange Rates"}],["$","p",null,{"style":"$a:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:style","children":["FX rates are sourced from the"," ",["$","strong",null,{"style":{"color":"#d4d4d8"},"children":"Frankfurter API"}]," (backed by European Central Bank data) via server route ",["$","code",null,{"style":"$12:props:children:6:props:children:1:props:style","children":"/api/fx-rate"}],", cached for 6 hours. Gulf-pegged currencies (AED, SAR, QAR, KWD, BHD) use fixed central-bank peg rates that are not subject to ECB market fluctuations."]}],["$","h3",null,{"style":"$12:props:children:1:props:style","children":"4.4 Material Grades"}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"overflowX":"auto","marginBottom":"1rem"},"children":["$","table",null,{"style":{"width":"100%","borderCollapse":"collapse","fontSize":"0.82rem","marginBottom":"0.5rem"},"children":[["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","th",null,{"style":{"textAlign":"left","padding":"0.5rem 0.75rem","color":"#52525b","fontWeight":700,"fontSize":"0.72rem","letterSpacing":"0.05em","textTransform":"uppercase","borderBottom":"1px solid #1c1c23"},"children":"Grade"}],["$","th",null,{"style":"$12:props:children:10:props:children:props:children:0:props:children:props:children:0:props:style","children":"Standard"}